---
title: Fallback — Gemini Fails or Is Too Slow
config:
  theme: base
  themeVariables:
    fontFamily: "Inter, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif"
    fontSize: 14px
---

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor reporter as Reporter
    participant line as LINE
    participant worker as App: worker<br/>workers/worker.py
    participant broadcaster as App: broadcaster<br/>workers/broadcaster.py
    participant redis as Redis
    participant postgres as PostgreSQL
    participant gemini as Gemini

    %% the fallback text is written in code, not by Gemini

    %% 1. Chat answer fails
    rect rgba(254, 202, 202, 0.3)
        worker ->> redis: BUFFERING to PROCESSING, read buffer
        worker ->> gemini: chat prompt + history + new messages
        alt Gemini error, or no answer in AI_TIMEOUT_SECONDS 50
            gemini --x worker: error or too slow
        else broken JSON, or no text left
            gemini -->> worker: bad answer
            worker ->> postgres: save ai_call, status error
        end
        Note over worker,gemini: any other failing step goes here too:<br/>loading, photo download, database, reply
        alt session SUSPENDED while Gemini was answering
            worker ->> redis: drop this round's messages from buffer
            Note over worker: no reply, the webhook already sent its fixed text
        else not suspended
            worker ->> line: reply fixed "system error, your story is kept, try again soon" text<br/>with the latest reply_token
            line ->> reporter: fixed text
            opt reply fails, reply_token older than 1 minute
                Note over worker: logged, no other way to answer
            end
        end
        worker ->> redis: PROCESSING to IDLE
        Note over worker,redis: buffer kept, no new chat job<br/>next message from the reporter: new chat job, Gemini sees the kept messages too
    end

    %% 2. Analyse job fails
    rect rgba(255, 190, 110, 0.12)
        loop up to 3 tries, only for broken JSON
            worker ->> gemini: analyser prompt + transcript
            gemini -->> worker: reports JSON
            Note over worker: broken JSON: save ai_call error, try again
        end
        Note over worker,postgres: Gemini error, or 3 broken answers: session stays closed, no reports<br/>nothing is sent to the reporter
    end

    %% 3. Broadcast fails
    rect rgba(120, 160, 255, 0.12)
        Note over broadcaster: forecast file not read by 08:00: friendly hello instead
        loop each picked person
            opt today's message not written yet
                broadcaster ->> gemini: write today's message
                gemini --x broadcaster: error, broken JSON, or no answer in 60 seconds
                Note over broadcaster: skip this person, the next person asks Gemini again
            end
            broadcaster -x line: push fails
            Note over broadcaster: skip this person, the next one gets the saved message
        end
        Note over broadcaster,postgres: a skipped person gets no message today<br/>and still counts as 1 of today's 10
    end
